const ComponentSettings=lazy(()=>import("./ComponentSettings")),WorldBindings=lazy(()=>import("./WorldBindings")),Groups=lazy(()=>import("./Groups")),PersonaManager=lazy(()=>import("./PersonaManager")),ResourceManager=lazy(()=>import("./ResourceManager")),Resources=lazy(()=>import("./Resources")),Characters=lazy(()=>import("./Characters"));
export const settingsPages=[["generation","生成配置",SlidersHorizontal],["connection","连接",Plug],["formatting","回复格式",TextCursorInput],["world","世界书",BookOpen],["settings","用户设置",Settings],["background","背景",Image],["extensions","扩展",Puzzle],["persona","用户设定",UserRound],["character","角色管理",UsersRound]] as const;
export default function SettingsWorkspace({host,page:initial,group:initialGroup,initial:resourceInitial,onClose,exiting}:{host:HostAdapter;page:SettingsPage;group?:string;initial?:string;onClose:()=>void;exiting?:boolean}){
 const snap=useHost(host),[closing,setClosing]=useState(false),[extensionId,setExtensionId]=useState("");
 const close=()=>{if(host.resourceAction)return;if(host.dirtyDraftKeys().length)setClosing(true);else onClose();};
 const [positions,setPositions]=useState<Record<string,string>>(()=>resourceInitial?{[initial==="generation"?"preset":initial]:resourceInitial}:{});
 const [page,setPage]=useState(initial),[group,setGroup]=useState(initialGroup||""),[selected,setSelected]=useState<Record<string,string[]>>({}),task=useTask(),ref=useRef<HTMLDialogElement>(null);
 useEffect(()=>{const handler=(e:Event)=>{setGroup((e as CustomEvent).detail.group);setExtensionId((e as CustomEvent).detail.extension||"");};window.addEventListener("wb-settings-group",handler);return()=>window.removeEventListener("wb-settings-group",handler);},[]);
 const resource=page==="generation"?"preset":page==="connection"||page==="world"?page:null;
 const groups=resource?(page==="world"?["条目编辑","绑定与全局设置"]:page==="generation"?["参数与预设","提示词","高级参数"]:["API 与连接管理"]):page==="persona"?["身份编辑","全局偏好"]:page==="character"?["全部角色","群组"]:nativePages[page].sections.map(s=>s.label);
 const active=groups.includes(group)?group:groups[0],def=settingsPages.find(p=>p[0]===page)!,PageIcon=def[2];
 const switchPage=(next:SettingsPage)=>{if(window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent("wb-before-close",{cancelable:true,detail:{preserveDrafts:true}}))){setPage(next);setGroup("");}};
 useEffect(()=>{const dialog=ref.current!,previous=document.activeElement as HTMLElement;dialog.showModal();document.body.classList.add("wb-settings-open");return()=>{dialog.close();document.body.classList.remove("wb-settings-open");previous?.focus();};},[]);
 return <dialog ref={ref} className="wb-ui wb-settings-workspace" data-wb-exiting={exiting||undefined} inert={exiting} aria-label="独立设置工作区" onCancel={e=>{e.preventDefault();close();}}>
  <header className="wb-settings-header"><button disabled={host.resourceAction} onClick={close}><ArrowLeft size={17}/>返回</button><strong><PageIcon size={19}/>{def[1]}</strong><span className="wb-grow"/><small>设置即时生效 · 资源草稿单独保存</small><button className="wb-primary" disabled={task.busy||host.resourceAction} onClick={()=>task.run(()=>host.persistSettings())}><Save size={16}/>保存设置</button><button className="wb-icon" aria-label="返回工作台" disabled={host.resourceAction} onClick={close}><X size={19}/></button></header>
  <div className="wb-settings-layout"><nav className="wb-settings-nav" aria-label="设置分类">{settingsPages.map(([id,label,Icon])=><button key={id} aria-pressed={page===id} disabled={host.resourceAction} onClick={()=>switchPage(id)}><Icon size={17}/>{label}</button>)}<footer>Noval 工作台<br/>独立设置工作区</footer></nav><main><nav className="wb-settings-subnav" aria-label="设置分组">{groups.map(g=><button key={g} aria-pressed={active===g} disabled={host.resourceAction} onClick={()=>{if(window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent("wb-before-close",{cancelable:true,detail:{preserveDrafts:true}})))setGroup(g);}}>{g}</button>)}{page==="settings"&&<ReadingSettings host={host}/>}</nav><Notice error={task.error}/><div className="wb-settings-body" key={page+":"+active}><Suspense fallback={<Loading/>}>
   {resource&&active!=="绑定与全局设置"&&active!=="高级参数"?<ResourceManager host={host} kind={resource} initial={positions[resource]} onPosition={id=>setPositions(p=>({...p,[resource]:id}))} selection={selected[resource]||[]} onSelection={ids=>setSelected(s=>({...s,[resource]:ids}))} view={active==="提示词"?"prompts":undefined}/>:active==="绑定与全局设置"?<WorldBindings host={host}/>:page==="persona"?<PersonaManager host={host} group={active} initial={positions.persona} onPosition={id=>setPositions(p=>({...p,persona:id}))}/>:page==="character"&&active==="全部角色"?<Characters host={host} management/>:page==="character"?<Groups host={host}/>:<ComponentSettings host={host} page={page} group={active} extensionId={extensionId}/> }</Suspense></div></main></div>
  <footer className="wb-settings-footer">常规设置即时生效 · 资源修改请保存<span className="wb-grow"/>SillyTavern 1.19.0</footer>
  {closing&&<Dialog title="离开设置工作区" onClose={()=>{if(!task.busy)setClosing(false);}}><div className="wb-confirm-body"><p>还有 {host.dirtyDraftKeys().length} 份资源草稿未保存。</p><Notice error={task.error}/><div className="wb-flex"><button disabled={task.busy} onClick={()=>setClosing(false)}>取消</button><span className="wb-grow"/><button disabled={task.busy} onClick={()=>{host.drafts.clear();onClose();}}>放弃修改</button><button className="wb-primary" disabled={task.busy} onClick={()=>task.run(async()=>{await host.saveDrafts();onClose();})}>保存并返回</button></div></div></Dialog>}
 </dialog>;
}
